sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Trainer as Kubeflow Trainer v2<br/>TrainJob Controller
    participant Kueue as Kueue<br/>Job Queueing
    participant Workers as Training Workers<br/>MPI+DDP Pods
    participant MinIO as MinIO<br/>9000/TCP S3
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MLflow as MLflow<br/>Experiment Tracking
    participant ModelReg as Model Registry

    Note over User,ModelReg: Distributed Training Flow (MPI+DDP SFT)

    User->>K8s: kubectl apply TrainJob CR
    K8s->>Trainer: TrainJob reconciliation
    Trainer->>Kueue: Submit workload for quota
    Kueue-->>Trainer: Workload admitted

    Trainer->>K8s: Create JobSet (launcher + workers)
    K8s->>Workers: Schedule MPI pods

    Workers->>HF: Download pre-trained model<br/>HTTPS/443
    HF-->>Workers: Model artifacts

    Workers->>MinIO: Load training dataset<br/>S3 API/9000
    MinIO-->>Workers: Dataset files

    Note over Workers: MPI+DDP distributed training<br/>NCCL ring-allreduce

    Workers->>MLflow: Log metrics & checkpoints
    Workers->>MinIO: Save checkpoints<br/>S3 API/9000

    Note over Workers: Training complete

    Workers->>MinIO: Upload final model<br/>S3 API/9000
    Workers->>ModelReg: Register trained model
    Workers-->>K8s: Job completed
    K8s-->>User: TrainJob status: Succeeded

    Note over User,ModelReg: HPO RayTune Flow

    User->>K8s: kubectl apply RayCluster + RayJob
    K8s->>Workers: Schedule Ray head + workers
    Workers->>MinIO: Store trial results<br/>S3 API/9000
    Workers-->>K8s: HPO trials completed
